<p><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cybersqyd" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5336470); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5336470&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607960934" alt="cybersqyd" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5336470)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cybersqyd" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5336470); return false;">cybersqyd</a></span><br />
<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thomas-delago" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6926935); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6926935&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607960934" alt="Thomas delago" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6926935)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thomas-delago" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6926935); return false;">Thomas delago</a></span><br />
(BTW holy crap my last one was totally escapism, you were right. WOW. Switching gears&#8230;)</p>
<p>Seeking To Greenlight: Yes</p>
<p>Page Type: SCP article</p>
<p>Page layout: Standard</p>
<p>Genre: [Insert Appropriate Genre Here, I've Forgotten The Rest]</p>
<p>Central Narrative: This was created by an &quot;anartist&quot; who is all about practical stuff. Would probably involve exploration of Whiteboard Dimension to her old notes and such.</p>
<p>Elevator Pitch: SCP-XXXX(-1, -2) are two wall-mounted whiteboards. Both whiteboards are usable like a touchscreen, and subjects can &quot;swipe&quot; through different &quot;screens&quot; to go back to old notes, or, they can pull down on the bottom of the whiteboard (causing it to lengthen to the floor), then pull out on the sides (causing it to widen enough for the subject to walk through), then walk through into the &quot;whiteboard dimension&quot; (SCP-XXXX-A). This dimension consists of a <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">giant-ass</span> white board that spans the entirety of the subject's field of view, similar to a billboard. Basically it stretches as far as the eye can see. The walkway is a grate, everything around them is just nothing but blue sky (including below), and there is a &quot;doorway&quot; to the real world which will follow the subject wherever they walk. The subject can also walk out of SCP-XXXX-2 (The other whiteboard) from there. This can be used as a form of &quot;teleportation&quot;. As long as the subject is holding a whiteboard marker, they will be able to write things on the board incredibly quickly (without touching it) and only using slight hand movements. The marker must be uncapped.</p>
<p>Hook: A Practical Approach To Note Taking, or, <strong>&quot;Fuck Stairs, I've Got <em>Whiteboards</em>, Motherfucker!&quot;</strong></p>
<p>Notes: I'm planning on making a few other SCPs with the same &quot;practical&quot; aspect, and maybe a Tale.</p>

