														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4842320">
									

<p>This concept just seems like escapism, which isn't really the purpose of the scp wiki, but this type of concept pops up pretty frequently (for example a bullied furry makes a clinic where he turns people into their fursonas or something similar.) The concept just seems really shallow, like someone that feels like the world isn't fair and wants to try to make one where it is, and if you want my honest opinion, I think this doesn't have a chance for anything, there isn't a concept for a narrative, nor a actually deep idea that can be expanded upon in any significant and long lasting way.</p>

